===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*armaz}}, further etymology uncertain.

Cognate with {{cog|ofs|erm}}, {{cog|osx|arm}}, {{cog|nl|arm}}, {{cog|goh|arm}} ({{cog|de|arm}}), {{cog|non|armr}} ({{cog|da|-}} and {{cog|sv|arm}}), {{cog|got|𐌰𐍂𐌼𐍃}}.

